docs {
  # POST /api/sales/ — Invalid sale data (400)

  Demonstrates missing/invalid FKs → `400` (distinct from vip `401`). Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `travels/views.py:127-134` + `travels/tests/test_views.py:491`.

  Body is intentionally broken: missing `client_email`, invalid FKs.

  ## Status codes

  - `400 Bad Request` — invalid sale data (other fields)

  ## Response (400)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid sale data",
    "errors": {
      "service_type": ["Clave primaria \"99\" inválida - objeto no existe."],
      "location": ["Clave primaria \"999\" inválida - objeto no existe."],
      "vehicle": ["Clave primaria \"999\" inválida - objeto no existe."],
      "client_name": ["Este campo es requerido."],
      "client_email": ["Este campo es requerido."]
    }
  }
  ```

  Spanish messages appear when `LANGUAGE_CODE='es-mx'` (`project/settings.py:154`).

  ## Notes

  - Compare with `post_create_invalid_vip_code.bru` `401` — different `message` and status.
}
